# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line ending handling.
#
# shell 脚本必须是 LF, 否则在 Windows 上(MSYS2/WSL)bash 会因为 CRLF 报
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M"。
#
# The test resources are compared byte by byte with the content stored in the
# prebuilt archives(tar/zip/tgz/...), those archives were generated on Linux
# with LF line endings. With core.autocrlf=true the text files would be
# checked out with CRLF on Windows and the comparison would fail, so force
# LF for the test resources and keep the archives binary.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sh  text eol=lf
tests/archive/res/** text eol=lf
tests/node/res/** text eol=lf
tests/compress/res/** text eol=lf

*.tar  -text
*.zip  -text
*.7z   -text
*.sqfs -text
*.gz   -text
*.tgz  -text
*.tbz2 -text
*.bz2  -text
*.xz   -text
